#. Theme URI of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "https://github.com/atokim4/shipnote"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Shipnote is a block theme for launch sites of small software products: a landing page, pricing, docs pages and a changelog that reads like a stack of dated release notes. It is set in Archivo and Source Serif 4 on warm paper with a signal-orange accent, and comes with dark and high-contrast style variations. Everything is built with core blocks, so you can edit every page in the Site Editor."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "atokim4"
msgstr ""

