#: patterns/faq.php:42
msgctxt "Sample FAQ answer"
msgid "They roll over to next week with a short note about why. Nothing is deleted when a week closes."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:47
msgctxt "Sample FAQ question"
msgid "Does it work offline?"
